  introTitle: Welcome to Cards Kingdom!
  introBody: "Your mission is to press SPACE as quickly as possible to collect only
    the card with THREE HEARTS. \n\nAll other cards are traps - ignore them and keep
    your focus on the red cross.\n\nKeep your focus on the red cross and avoid distractions.\n\nPress
    SPACE to start. Good luck! "
