  trainingIntroTitle: Welcome to Cards Kingdom!
  trainingIntroBody: "Your task is to press SPACE as quickly and accurately as possible
    to collect only the card with THREE hearts.\n\nAll other cards are traps - ignore
    them and keep your focus on the red plus sign.\n\nWhen you\u2019re ready, press
    SPACE to begin a training round."
  readyIntroTitle: Focus
  readyIntroBody: "Random visual and audio distractions will appear -  ignore them
    and keep your focus on the red plus sign.\n\nAt the end of the round, you\u2019ll
    collect a gem. More correct cards mean a stronger gem and a faster way home.\n\nPress
    SPACE to begin the real mission. Good luck!"
